<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐκαί-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>setting right, doing justice to:</i> hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>condemnation, punishment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				40.43
			</span></i> (pl.), cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.421d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>plea of legal right, justification,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				9.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>making</i> or <i>accounting righteous, justification,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Rom.
				4.25
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>demand of right</i> or <i>as of right, just claim,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>judgement of what is right,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντήλλαξαν τῇ δικαιώσει</span> altered
				<i>at their will and pleasure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.82
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
